* AI training checkpoint vdbench v1 - prepare only
* Source model:
* - Meta DSI / ISCA 2022: large-scale training repeatedly reads and filters stored datasets.
* - MLPerf Storage checkpointing / DLIO: checkpoint write, read, and recovery semantics.
* This file only creates the CephFS dataset. Do not use for repeated measurement runs.
* Dataset ranks are equal-capacity shards used by the run profile to express Zipfian access skew.

data_errors=1
create_anchors=yes
messagescan=no

hd=default,vdbench=@VDBENCH_HOME@,user=@REMOTE_USER@,shell=ssh
hd=hd1,system=@HOST1@

fsd=default,depth=1,width=1,shared=yes,openflags=o_direct
fsd=fsd_dataset_rank_01,anchor=@ANCHOR@/dataset_rank_01,files=250,size=20m
fsd=fsd_dataset_rank_02,anchor=@ANCHOR@/dataset_rank_02,files=250,size=20m
